<title>CHINA: China Industrial and Commercial Bank deposits up.</title>
<headline>China Industrial and Commercial Bank deposits up.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Personal savings deposits at China's Industrial and Commercial Bank reached 1.127 trillion yuan ($135.7 billion) at the end of November, up 220.1 billion yuan from the same time in 1995, the Xinhua news agency said.</p>
<p>The bank planned to expand its services in 1997 to attract more deposits, the agency said without giving further details.</p>
<p>($=8.3 yuan)</p>
